      "title": "L1 extraction reviewer",
      "notation": "l1-extraction-reviewer",
      "description": "Signs, or rejects, the exclusions an L1 extraction proposes: each normative-looking sentence of a WHO publication that the curation says is not a recommendation, an implementation practice or a remark. Until a person acting in this role signs an exclusion, its sentence stays unaccounted and coverage stays below 100 %. Owner ruling 3b, 2026-10-12: exclusions are signed by this named role, never by the agent that proposed them. Inherits the harness's generic reviewer and performs exclusion sign-off in `classify-and-code-content.bpmn` (bean 4nfs).",
